# Always publish to main

When game/app work is finished and ready for players:

1. Merge the feature branch into `main` (resolve conflicts if needed).
2. Push `main` so GitHub Actions `Deploy azztech.online/apps/tf` runs (web + OTA).
3. Do not leave finished player-facing fixes only on draft PR branches.
4. Confirm deploy succeeded and OTA `latest.php` moved past the previous version when the change should reach mobile.

Draft PRs are fine while iterating. Shipping means `main` + deploy, not "PR open forever."
